<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="PHP" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">Philipiite</para>
  <para style="toc1">PHILIPIITE suh Pool ih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">Philipiite</para>
  <para style="toc3">Phl</para>
  <para style="mt1">PHILIPIITE</para>
  <para style="mt2">Suh Pool Ih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Pool ih Philipiite loong suh</char> Iurop hah ni chaas phangdong hoonta hadaang, Roman juungkhuung Mesidonia hah adi le ah maat raangta. Erah raang maatta tok adi heh phaatak ni tongta, Kristo mina wahoh mihak phokhoh loong Philipi Chaas ni tiitmoong nyootte loong ah ih heh cham thuk rumta. Ang abah uh arah leeraang nawa ih tenroonjih nyia amiisak ih laalomjih Pool ih heh mongtang tenthun nawa ih tiitkhaap ah Jisu Kristo suh hanpi ano jangbaat kaatla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Arah le maat raang ah jaakhothoon Philipiite Kristo mina loong ih neng lakchoh maatkaat rumta thoih jengkhaapse maat raang suh liita. Heh ih erah raangmaat rumta ah langla, neng chamnaang tokdoh tenchaan toom ang rum ah ih thunta. Heh ih neng suh Jisu toongtang tenthun lam ih toom tongsong rum ah ih huk baat rumta, engaampo nyia nyamnyook tenthun loong ah naktoom ang rum ah eah. Jisu Kristo damdoh neng roidong roongrungla rah esiit Rangte heh minchan lakkot neng tuungmaang jun ih choh rumla, Jehudi loong Hootthe lam ah phan thoih tah angka. O mina Jisu Kristo damdi tongla erah loong asuh Rangte ih tenroon nyia semroongroong ah koh ah ih raangmaat rumha.</para>
  <para style="ip">Arah leeraang maatta adi, ehan ah Kristo mina hanpi jun ih, tenroon, laalom, jengjun nyia Kristaan roidong tiit ah baat ha. Erah dam ih Pool ih Philipi Chaas mina loong suh heh tenthet tiit ah baat rum ah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:1-11">1:1-11</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pool heh teeteewah ih thoijat arah loong<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:12-26">1:12-26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kristo roidong<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 1:27-2:18">1:27—2:18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Timothi nyia Epaphroditas raang ih kaankoong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 2:19-30">2:19-30</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Piiara nyia Choophaan phaan angte suh jengkhaap thih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 3:1-4:9">3:1—4:9</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pool nyia Philipi nawa heh joon awaan<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:10-20">4:10-20</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hethoonhemat<char style="ior">(<ref loc="PHP 4:21-23">4:21-23</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:12">Esm 16:12</ref> </char>
    </note> Philipi nawa Rangte mina Kristo damdi tongte, Chaas phansiitte nyia neng damdi roongmoote loong suh Pool nyia Timothi Rangte laksuh wanyi jiin nawa arah jengkhaap rah ah:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Seng loong Wah Rangte nyia seng Teesu Jisu Kristo ih sen suh semroongroong nyia heh tenthet ah toom kohan.</para>
  <para style="s">Pool rangsoom heh leewette suh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngah ih nga Rangte suh sen dokthun saapoot rookwih di lakookmi kali ang; <verse number="4" style="v"/>nyia saapoot rookwih ngah ih sen raang ih rangsoom angdi, tenroon lam ih kah soom ang <verse number="5" style="v"/>tumeah ruurangese tiit phang tumbaat tang tok dowa ih amah tuk ih sen ih chosok hali. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Eno ngah ih kamkam ih thunhang seng Rangte, sen suh ese mootkaat phang re thukte warah ih hethoon doh Jisu Kristo Rangwuung maang thokthok tuk ih ese lam ih thoonsiit kohe. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngah ih sen samthun rumhala ah epunthun et hang tumeah, sen ah saarookwih ngah ten ni tonglan! Rangte ih heh tiit tumbaat suh saapoot kotahang adi sen loong ih roong chosok tahe, amadi ngah phaatak ni tonglang tokdi nyia maangtong tokdi Rangte ruurangese raang ih laattang dowa ih dook ah. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ngah ih sen loong nga ten nawa ih samthun rumhala rah Jisu Kristo heteewah tenthun thun nawa ih dong thunthuk halang, nga haaki ah Rangte.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sen loong chamchi nah ese tenthun nyia sekthun ah, mongnook lam ih ehan han ih hak raangtaan suh nga rangsoom ban jeela, <verse number="10" style="v"/>eno ba sen ih marah eseethoon ah mi danje an. Erah dowa ih ba sen ah Kristo rangwuung sa doh kaanju muh saksa ang an. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Jisu Kristo luulu ih Rangte men raksiit suh jen dongsiit ha amiisak ese dang ajang rah ih sen roidong ah meethuk ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Ething tongjih ah Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, ngah ih sen suh jatthuk suh ramlang ah langla, nga chamnaang tungthoidi ba amiisak Rangte tiit ah ehan han ih jaat jaangjih ih hoon kata. <verse number="13" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:30">Esm 28:30</ref> </char></note> Mamah liidi, luungwang nok bante loongtang ih ngah phaatak ni tonglang asuh Kristo laksuh ang kano botongla ih dongjat rumha. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah dam ih hanpiite loong ah ih ngah phaatak ni tongkang no neng tenthun ah Teesu jiinko kamkam ih dong thun rumha, erah dowa ih ba neng ih Rangte tiit ah saapoot rookwih lacho laphaan ih tumbaat rum ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Elang eah Kristo tiit ah mararah ih bah ethih tenthunte nyia changrook mina loong ih roong baat ha, enoothong mararah mina ih bah amiisak ese tenthun nawa ih baat ha. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Erah loong ah mongnook tenthun lam ih re ah, tumeah, Rangte ih heh ruurangese tiit pangsuh mothuk halang ah neng ih ejat eha. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Rukho loong ih Kristo tiit ah toongtang lam in tabaat rumka, erah nang ih bah nyamnyook tenthun lam ih baat rumha; neng ih ngah phaatak ni tonglang tokdoh ehan ih boot chamnaang thuk suh thun rumha.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Enoothong erah ih tumjih angjih bah tah angka! Erah nang ih bah Kristo tiit ah ese lam angkoja oh adoleh ethih tenthun lam ih angkoja oh etumbaat et ha asuh thong roonlang. Eno ngah ah toomroon ruh ete anglang, <verse number="19" style="v"/>tumeah, ngah ih jat ehang Jisu Kristo chiiala lam ih sen rangsoom nawa ih chosok hali thoi ngah ah phaatak nawa edok ete anglang. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ngah ih nga tenni kamkam ih thun angno laalom lang, nga mootkaat doh babah uh nga rakri dongjih tamokang, etek ejih angkojang oh adoleh ething angkojang oh, nga tenchaan amadi anglang jun ih Kristo men ah ngah puh putang ih raksiit ang. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erabah roidong ah tumjih ah? Ngah di bah, khothing roidong ah Kristo, etek ah tang ehan eseethoon roidong chojih ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Enoothong amamah khothing ih ban tongsong ruh eh angbah mootkaat ese ah ngah ehanhan ih boot moh ang, ngah ih marah danjeejih ah erah tajatkang. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ngah lamnyi nawa ih pheehoom halang. Ngah roidong ah thiinhaat suh nyia Kristo damdoh tong suh ah rapne ih thunhang, marah eseethoon ang ah; <verse number="24" style="v"/>enoothong ngah ething ih tong ah sen raangtaan suh maaklong doh chap ang. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Erah ngah ih kamkam ih thunhang, ngah ah sen damdoh ething ih roongtong hangno sen tenroon nyia sen tuungmaang boot huk korumha, <verse number="26" style="v"/>eno ba ngah sen damdoh we roongtong hang adoh, sen roidong doh sen ah Jisu Kristo suh ehan han ih boot khuungpook roonsoonjih ang an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Amadi, sen suh elongthoon reejih ah langla sen ruurangese ah Kristo tiit jun ih tongsong andoh se ah, eno ba ngah ih sen ah Rangte tiit suh rongrong ih tuungmaang laalom rum ano tongsong rumla ih japchaat ang, sen reenah ngah raahang no nga mik ih sok ra rumha bah uh adoleh lajen raarang bah uh ah, sen ah chiiala esiit nawa ih rongchap thuk halan ih jat ang. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Senpi senra loong suh lacho theng; saarookwih tarong ih bantong an, eno ba senpi senra loong ah ih dongjat ah neng ah rangne eno sen ah rangkap eah, tumeah sen suh Rangte ih rangkap angjih ah kotahan. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Erah thoih sen suh Kristo mootkaat ah moh suh saapoot ah kohalan, heh suh hanpi laklak lah angthang ih, heh raangtaan ih chamnaang nep ih suh. <verse number="30" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:19-40">Esm 16:19-40</ref> </char></note>Amadoh sen ngah damdoh raamui thengnah jen roong rung ehan. Erah raamui ah sen ih ehak di katup tahe raamui ah muilang, eno amadi chaat han rah uh erah raamui ah thok muilang.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Kristo toongtang nyia elong tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Sen roidong ah Kristo damdi ang thoih rongtangtang ang thuk halan, nyia heh minchan ih sen ah kooncha halan. Sen Esa Chiiala damdi roomtong lan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:1</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sen Esa Chiiala damdi roomtong lan</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh</char><char style="fq" closed="false">Esa Chiiala ih sen ah esiit esiit eroom ih thoksiit halan. </char></note> nyia sen jiinni minchan nyi tenthet ah esiit esiit suh eje. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Sen suh ngah ih baat rumhala, sen loong ah tenthun esiit, mongnook esiit, thung atak nyia chiiala lam nah esiit ang anno ngah ah roonthuk he. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tumjih uh nyamnyook tenthun nawa ih nak re an adoleh lalangka lam ih nak ngaampo an, erah nang ih bah esiit esiit damdoh toongtang lam ih tong an, saarookwih senteewah nang ih wahoh ah ese ih samthun an. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Nyia wahoh ih tumjih thunha erah roong samthun suh thun an sen teeteewah tenthun nah laklak lah angthang ih ah. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Senthung sentak ah Jisu Kristo thung atak angta likhiik angtheng:</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Heh di saarookwih Rangte dang ajang ah jeeta,</para>
  <para style="q2">enoothong heh ih mamah ih bah uh Rangte thanthan ih hoon suh tathuntakta.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Erah nang ih, heh teeteewah thung nawa ih heh di tumjih jeeta loong ah thiinhaat ano,</para>
  <para style="q2">laksuh angjih dang ajang ah kapta.</para>
  <para style="q1">Heh ah mina likhiik ih dong hoonta</para>
  <para style="q2">nyia mina jih ajaat likhiik ih dong taha.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Heh ah toongtang angta erah dam ih Rangte jeng chaatchaat lam ih heh roidong ah thoonta—</para>
  <para style="q2">bangphak ni laan tek ruh ah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Erah thoih Rangte ih heh ah echoong thoon rangkothung ni saatsiit wanta</para>
  <para style="q2">eno heh men ah o men nang ih uh elongthoon et men kota.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:10,11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 45:23">Isa 45:23</ref> (LXX)</char>
    </note> Erah tungthoih, Jisu men ah soomtu suh</para>
  <para style="q2">jaatrep rangmong nawa, hatoh nawa, nyia mongrep hakhu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mongrep hakhu: Hakhu ni tekchoite loong ah rangnak mong ni eje ih thun rumta. </char></note> nawa loong ah</para>
  <para style="q2">neng lakuh doh tong rum ah,</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>eno loongtang ih saasa lam ih Jisu Kristo ah seng Teesu ih tumbaat rum ah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Rangte hewah men ah raksiit suh ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Mongrep ni weephaak likhiik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Erah thoih, nga joonte loong, ngah sen damdi ang tokdi saarookwih sen ah nga jeng chaatchaat kah etan, eno amadi ngah haloot ni anglang tok adoh tang ehan ih nga jeng ah thaangchaat an, erah sen raangtaan suh maaklong doh chap ah. Sen khopiiroidong ah chosuh bah emocho damdoh pakna ruh ih kah an, <verse number="13" style="v"/>tumeah Rangte ih sen loong ah heh mootkaat nah jen reethuk suh nyia heh jeng chaatchaat jen ang thuk suh saarookwih sen roidong ni ban moruh ehala.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Jaatrep ah changrook waangti nyia jengdaan muh ih re an, <verse number="15" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:5">Hodb 32:5</ref> </char></note> arah mongrep adi bah ethih reeraang pakna nyia rangdah mina loong meela, eno sen ah erah mina loong damdoh toongtang nyia saachamcham ih tongsong an Rangte suh asah mi jen angsuh ah. Sen loong ah neng dung nah rangkhothung echoong ni reksih phaakla likhiik jaatjaat ih phaak theng, <verse number="16" style="v"/>tumeah sen ih neng suh khothing roidong tiit ah baat han. Sen loong ah emamah ih re anbah Kristo Rangwuung sa doh ngah sen suh rapne ih khuungpook roonsoonjih ang ah, tumeah erah sa doh bah ngah reeraang pakna tang loong ah thaangmuh ni taboh angka ih jat ang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sen tuungmaang nyia sen mootkaat ah Rangte suh khojoop siik hoon arah likhiik. Eno nga sih ah erah khojoop siik hoon adoh jan adoh botseh ngah sen suh tenroon ang ang. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Emamah, sen uh tenroon angjih eno nga damdoh tenroon ih roong tongtha han.</para>
  <para style="s">Timothi nyia Epaphroditus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Teesu thungpun abah, ngah ih sen jiinnah Timothi ah elaang ih daapkaat suh ejen thun et ang, eno ba sen ruurang ah chaat angno nga tenthun ah rongkopkop ang ah. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nga tenthun jun ih roong samthunte nyia sen loong amiimi ih koonchaate warah heh luulu ju angkah. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Mirep ih Jisu ah lasamthun thang ih, neng di marah seela erah ba samthun rumha. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Sen ih jat ehan Timothi heteewah ah tumjaat mina ah ih noisok hali rah ah, hewah damdi heh sah roong mola likhiik ih, heh ah nga damdam ruurangese tiit roong tumbaat taha. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Erah thoih, ngah tumjih angte erah jat ang no ba Timothi ah sen jiinnah elaang ih daapkaat suh ban samthun hang. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Erah dam ih ngah ih Teesu suh kamkam ih samthun hang, nga teewah ah elaang ih sen jiinnah ejen chomoi ih raahang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ngah ih thun etang Epaphroditus, nga damdi Rangte tiit roong tumbaatte wah, toongtang sipaahi tiitbaatte pangte nyia sen ih ngah chosok suh sen kaamwah ih daapjah tahan ah sen jiinnah ngaak daapjih jaatjaat eah. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Heh ih sen chosok suh rapne ih mongsaam la nyia thungjoongla, tumeah sen ih heh ah esat ela ih japchaat etan. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Elang eah heh ah rapne ih satta, etek nep taat eta, enoothong Rangte ih tenthet ano ngaak deesiitta, heh laklak lah angthang ih ngah nep tenthet tahang, sootsaam khodoh sootsaam phoboot ang ah eah. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Erah thoih sen jiinnah daapkaat suh ngah ih ehan ih samthun hang, eno ba sen ih heh ah japtup ano ehan ih roon an, eno nga sootsaam anep mat eah. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Eno bah, sen ih heh ah tenroon lam ih Teesu mendoh sen phono likhiik ih ban noppoon an. Eno heh soongraang han likhiik mih uh emamah ih soongraang an, <verse number="30" style="v"/>tumeah heh ih heh roidong ah Kristo tiit thoi etek nep taat ih arah ih kota, ngah chosok suh nep marah sen ih botseh lajen chosok tahe rah suh ah.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Amiisak kateng tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hethoondi, joon awaan loong ngah ih baat rumhala, Teesu damdi roong rooplan asuh tenroon ang an! Ngah ih helek helek ih raangmaat halang ah tathet thunkang, sen ah punpiipi toom ih tong an ih thunhang. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ethih mote, hui lajak loong sak khan suh laat ram rumla loong dowa pui ean. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Amiisak ih khoopkhan cho abah seng, neng tah angka, tumeah seng ih Rangte ah heh Chiiala lam ih soom eno seng roidong ah tenroon lam ih Jisu Kristo damdi roong tongli. Seng ih hansi rangkhokhoop khan banlam adi amasah uh tah laalomke. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Elang eah, erah likhiik banlam adoh ngah uh emi laalom eh ang. O ih bah uh erah rangkhoh khoopkhan banlam adoh jen laalom ih mokthun anbah, ngah di tang erah nang ih ehan ih thuntheng lam je ah. <verse number="5" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 23:6">Esm 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:5">26:5</ref></char></note> Saasinet noodek di nga khoopkhan banlam hoon tahang, ngah ah Ijirel mina ih tup raahang rah, Benjamin jaat apaat, amiisak ih Hebru mina. Jehudi loong Hootthe thok banlamta bah, ngah ah Pharasi mina ang thengtang, <verse number="6" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Esm 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26:9-11</ref></char></note>eno erah tokdi ngah ih Chaas thet haat asuh rapne ih ram angno kah siiwi rumtang. Mina ah Hootthe jengdang ah kap ano kateng ang ah ih liita, erah tok adi, ngah uh kateng ju angtang. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Enoothong edak chojih taat ih rookweh tang ah, amadi Kristo raangtaan ih thaangmuh ih hoonla. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erah loong laklak lah angthang ih; ngah ih thun angdi jirep ah nga Teesu Jisu Kristo jattang dowa ih bah erah loong ah thoontang emat haatjih ih hoonla. Erah raang ih heh tungthoidi ngah ih erah loong ah jaatrep ehaat etang; ngah ih erah loong asuh thaangmuh ih thiik hang, eno ba ngah ah Kristo damdoh jen ang angno <verse number="9" style="v"/>heh damdoh esiit ih hoon ang. Ngah ih Hootthe ah phan angno kateng ih kathun tang ah amadoh takah angka. Amadi kateng anglang abah Kristo suh hanpi angno anglang, marah Rangte jiin nawa hanpi jun ih chojih rah asuh ah. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ngah ih jamhang ah langla ngah ih Kristo ah jat ang, eno tek nawa ngaakthingta chaan aphaan anep roongjat ang, heh chamnaang ah roong hui et ang, nyia heh tekta likhiik ih roongtek ang, <verse number="11" style="v"/>nga teewah nep heh tek nawa ngaakthingta likhiik ih roong ngaakthing ang ih laalom lang.</para>
  <para style="s">Ethok theng ko ih soontheng</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngah ih jaatrep ah ejen choh etang adoleh ngah jaatrep di epun elang ih taliikang. Amadi uh ngah ih hethaang ah chosuh chekbek lang marah Jisu Kristo ih erah raang ih ngah ah danjoh tahang. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Joon awaan loong, elang eah, amiimi di ngah ih ejen jen ettang ih tathunkang; enoothong jaatsiit ngah reelang abah, liko dowa ah beehaat angno lakngah nawa eseethoon adoh thok suh reelang. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah thoih ngah lamjunko maradi thaangchojih angla adi soonlang, Rangte ih Jisu Kristo mendi rangkhothung nawa roidong ah chosuh poon halang rah di ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Seng loongtang mathan mina chiiala lam ih thungsek angte loong ah ih, emamah ih samthun theng. Enoothong sen mararah mina doh thung atak jaat hoh mok ang anbah, Rangte ih sen suh toom miidong thunthuk han. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Mamah ang abah uh, amatuk ih marah banlam jah hali emamah lakngah nah erah aju phankaat ih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 4:16">1Kr 4:16</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:1">11:1</ref> </char>
    </note>Joon awaan loong, nga reeraang ah nyootsok he. Seng ih baat hi lampo adi o mina ih ese reeraang nyoot ha erah loong ah naririh ih ban sok an. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Arah tiit ah jaakhoni helek helek ih baat rum taha, eno amadi uh nga mikphi ah janhaat lam ih we baat rumhala: Kristo bangphak ni tiita rah rukho roidong ni neng piiara ih hoon arah uh eje. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Neng loong ah soolam nah thoon wangte ang rumla, tumeah neng rangte ah neng hansi tenthun ni ang thoidi ah. Neng marah doh erakriijih angta adi mok ngaampo ih rumla, erah dam ih neng thung mongrep hadaang nawa adi luulu thun rumha. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Seng loong ah ang koleh, rangmong nawa noksong, erah thoih seng Pangteewah Teesu Jisu Kristo ah rangmong nawa ngaakkaat ah bantho hi. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Heh ih seng larook lata hansi sak etek etheng ah leksiit heeno, heteewah sak phaakjaaja ang arah likhiik ih hoonhe, eno jaatrep chaan aphaan ah maak ano heh lakhu nah jen loomsiit he.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Helam baat kot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah thoih, joon awaan loong, sen ah nga mongnook mina, ngah ih mamah ma ih jen beehaat rumha! Sen ih ngah mathan ih roonthuk hali nyia ngah sen tungthoi ih mathan ih khona lang! Arah likhiik ih sen roidong nah Teesu suh hanpi anno rongrong ih tong an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Euodia nyia Sintaichi, ngah ih set suh baat we nyu hala, set ah soonah likhiik ih Teesu mendoh esiit ang we ansih. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Nga joonwah an ih uh erah nuh nyi ah chosok ih weeuh; tumeah nengnyi ah nga damdi Rangte tiit baat rapne ih roong khoom nyu taha, erah dam ih Kolement nyia nga joonte wahoh loong ah nep marah men Rangte roidong leedap ni raangthiin cho loong damdoh ah.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sen ah Teesu damdam ih saarookwih tenroon toom ih tong an. Ngah we jenglang: tenroon ang an!</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Warep damdoh toongtang lam ih re an. Teesu ah echaan ih ra hala. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Tumjih suh uh nak sootsaam an, erah nang ih bah jaatrep ah Rangte dowa sen ih jam han ah rangsoom lam ih suh an, sen ten nawa ih lakookmi jengkhaap ra lam ih ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Eno Rangte jiin nawa semroongroong ah mina ih lajen samthunka rah ih punpiipi senthung sentak nah Jisu Kristo damdoh toomroong tong thuk han.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Hethoon doh, joon awaan loong, sen tenthun ah marah ese nyia ih eguujih rah ih meethuk an: marah amiisak tiit rah ih, lathet sokjih, epunjih ih, esaajih, jaaseejih ih nyia mih ih thangjih loong rah ih meethuk an. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sen ih nga jiin nawa jengkhaap angkoja oh reeraang angkoja oh tumjaat choh an nyia nyoot han loong ah sen lakmoot lam ih pakna reeraang kah an. Eno ba semroongroong kotte wah Rangte ah seng damdam ang ha.</para>
  <para style="s">Lakchoh kot raang ih lakookmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Nga roidong di Teesu damdi roongtang angdi nga rapne ih roonlang sen ih rekam lidi leksiit nga kooncha saapoot ah we choh noisok anno ah. Enoothong nga kooncha ah etoohaat ettan ih taliikang—enoisok saapoot ah tachotan. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Arah tiit ah ngah takah sokboi rumrang ih taliikang, tumeah ngah di tumjih jeela erah mamet maak angno tenchemjih ang ah erah ejat ehang. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ngah ih jat ehang changthet doh mame tongtha theng ah nyia eje doh adoh mame tongtha theng rah ah. Ngah ih arah husah tiit ah ejat ehang, erah thoih maatok doh maanah ang abah uh, ngah ih naan et ang ramtek doh angkojao, wokphoot doh ang koja oh, hantek ang adoh uh amasah taan uh laje ang tokdoh uh. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Jirep saapoot doh jen naanjih chaan ah Jisu Kristo ih ngah suh koh etahang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enoothong sen ih ngah chamchoh tokdi chosok tahe ah rapne ese ih reetan. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Philipi mina loong sen ih bah jat ehan ngah Mesidonia hadaang dowa Ruurang Ese tiit tumbaat suh teewadi kah dok khoomtang adi, sen Chaas luulu juuba angta ngah chosokte ah; sen luulu ih ba roongjat tahe nga thaapnya nyia ngah thaang dakchoh rah ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Esm 17:1</ref></char></note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:9">2Kr 11:9</ref> </char></note>Ngah Thesolonika hadaang ni ang tokdi uh sen ih helek helek ih ngah suh hukkhaak kamaat kaat tahan. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Sen ih lakchoh ih kotahe ah chothaang angno taliikang; erah nang ih bah sen lakkot thaang dakchoh ean rah chotup suh ramlang. <verse number="18" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:18">Hpkt 29:18</ref></char></note>Sen ih ngah suh lakchoh ih chokoh tahe rah arah loong ah—eno erah loong ah laanlang ruh ehan angta! Amadi ngadi jirep eje, sen ih lakchoh ih kottahe loong ah Epaphroditus ih echoh kokaat ih tahang. Eno erah lakchoh ah Rangte suh tummangmang ang arah khosa lakkot likhiik, erah lakchoh kottahe asuh Rangte ih tenroon lam ih thang eha. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Eno nga Rangte ih heh nyamka loong mong dowa rah ih, sen suh Jisu Kristo mendoh tumjih suh nook an erah ban kohan. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Seng loong Wah Rangte men ah roitang raang ih phaakjaaja toom ang ah! Amen.</para>
  <para style="s">Hethoon jengseera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Rangte mina loong esiit esiit suh Jisu Kristo mendi jengkhaapse raahang. Nga dam dowa hanpiite loong ih nep sen suh jengkhaapse maat halan. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Aa nawa Rangte mina loong ih, ehanthoon ah Luungwanglong Kesar nok dowa loong ah ih jengkhaapse maat halan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Seng Teesu Jisu Kristo minchan ah sen loong damdam toom ang ha.</para>
</usx>
